A recent-transactions card: All / Income / Spending filter tabs over rows of icon tiles, counterparties, categories,
dates and signed amounts. A **block** composed from [Tabs](<%= page_path(:tabs) %>),
[Thumbnail](<%= page_path(:thumbnail) %>) and Icon, as on the [Appica homepage](https://appica.dev/ui).

<%= embed AppicaUI::Blocks::TransactionsPreview, :default %>

## Usage

```ruby
Transactions(currency: account.currency) do
  account.transactions.recent.each do |transaction|
    Transaction(title: transaction.counterparty, category: transaction.category, date: transaction.booked_on,
      amount: transaction.amount, icon: transaction.icon)
  end
end
```

- A positive `amount:` is income (a `+` in the success color), a negative one spending (`-`); both use the
  block's `currency:` and the locale's number format.
- The tabs filter the rows in the browser by that kind (`appica-ui--blocks--transactions`); a filter with no rows shows
  "No transactions yet". `filters: false` drops the tabs.
- The meta line joins `category:` and `date:` (formatted per locale).

## Localization

`transactions.locales.yml` holds the title, the tab labels, the empty message and the date format for English,
Czech, German and Arabic. Switch the **Locale** display option to try it.

