## API reference

### Transactions

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title:` | `String` | translated | Heading ("Recent transactions"). |
| `currency:` | `String` | `"USD"` | Currency of every amount. |
| `filters:` | `Boolean` | `true` | Show the All / Income / Spending tabs. |

### Transaction

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title:` | `String` | - | Counterparty or description. |
| `amount:` | `Numeric` | - | Positive for income, negative for spending. |
| `category:` | `String` | - | Shown before the date. |
| `date:` | `Date` | - | Formatted with the locale's `date_format`. |
| `icon:` | `Symbol` | `:receipt` | Icon in the outline tile. |

## Accessibility

- The rows are a list named by the title; the tabs are a labelled tablist ("Filter transactions").
- The sign and color both mark income, so the amount doesn't rely on color alone.
